WEBVTT

01:41.479 --> 01:45.979
[Love of the Divine Tree]

01:46.580 --> 01:48.930
[Episode 16]

02:00.330 --> 02:01.400
I didn't realize there's a finite number

02:01.430 --> 02:02.400
of good days in one's life.

02:04.090 --> 02:05.520
In the blink of an eye,

02:06.530 --> 02:07.760
all has passed and only a few memories

02:07.790 --> 02:08.710
are left for me to savor.

02:09.800 --> 02:11.520
I'm sorry I have failed you.

02:13.680 --> 02:14.840
If there's a next life,

02:15.800 --> 02:17.520
I'll give you a proper apology.

02:52.910 --> 02:54.150
Do you know where she's buried?

03:03.030 --> 03:06.000
[Tomb of My Dear Friend Mrs. Jiang]

03:13.310 --> 03:15.240
It's said that burning a child's swaddling cloth

03:16.120 --> 03:16.710
at his or her mother's grave

03:16.710 --> 03:18.360
is a way to thank the mother for raising the child.

03:19.870 --> 03:21.310
Your mother will rest in peace.

03:23.230 --> 03:24.829
They never asked me.

03:26.190 --> 03:27.240
They just made decisions for me.

03:28.510 --> 03:30.030
They lived and ended their lives because of me.

03:32.210 --> 03:32.710
Maybe

03:32.710 --> 03:33.800
I just don't have the right to decide anything.

03:36.110 --> 03:38.040
After all, I'm the reason for all that has happened.

03:41.750 --> 03:43.470
The Heavenly Bottle didn't bother me anymore,

03:45.800 --> 03:47.470
but you still risked your life to get it.

03:52.150 --> 03:52.960
Mrs. Jiang

03:53.820 --> 03:54.770
just wanted you

03:54.800 --> 03:55.750
to live a good life.

03:57.120 --> 03:58.960
As for why she made decisions for you,

03:59.910 --> 04:01.310
I don't think the reason is complicated.

04:03.240 --> 04:05.000
When you love someone with all your heart,

04:06.320 --> 04:07.370
you can think of nothing

04:07.400 --> 04:08.400
but a simple idea.

04:09.590 --> 04:10.870
That is, to give what you consider the best

04:10.870 --> 04:11.960
to this person.

04:17.120 --> 04:18.640
But the gods of fate love playing tricks on people.

04:19.800 --> 04:21.100
If someone takes

04:21.630 --> 04:22.680
just one more step forward,

04:23.490 --> 04:24.810
everything will be different.

04:25.720 --> 04:26.830
But that step

04:27.600 --> 04:28.950
happens to be the hardest to take.

04:31.070 --> 04:31.650
Master,

04:32.810 --> 04:33.940
this is not her fault,

04:34.870 --> 04:36.070
nor is it yours.

04:48.430 --> 04:49.240
You see,

04:50.280 --> 04:51.390
one cannot undo the past,

04:51.950 --> 04:53.040
so it's no use clinging to it.

04:53.920 --> 04:55.000
If what has happened is too messy to figure out,

04:55.490 --> 04:56.490
then just leave it be.

04:57.360 --> 04:58.070
The most important thing

04:58.560 --> 04:59.870
is to live in the present day.

05:00.830 --> 05:02.270
Just drink the wine you want now,

05:06.000 --> 05:06.950
and meet

05:07.430 --> 05:08.390
whoever you'd love to see.

05:10.390 --> 05:11.560
Only when you live your life this way,

05:11.950 --> 05:13.190
will you be free of regrets,

05:14.030 --> 05:15.250
and make every second count.

05:25.680 --> 05:27.390
Master, take your time with the mourning.

05:28.390 --> 05:29.390
I'll wait for you over there.

06:03.040 --> 06:05.000
The power of the Spirit Dispelling Formation is gone.

06:06.560 --> 06:07.970
There is no more excuse for me

06:08.000 --> 06:09.390
to stay with Master.

06:16.630 --> 06:17.720
Tomorrow morning,

06:18.630 --> 06:20.430
Master will probably ask me to go back to Mount Wester.

06:29.870 --> 06:31.040
Meet whoever I'd love to see,

06:32.080 --> 06:33.090
and make every second count.

06:53.000 --> 06:54.950
Master told me to hold his hand.

06:57.120 --> 06:59.000
His hand felt so soft!

06:59.830 --> 07:01.630
I wish I could be struck by the Peach Blossom Intoxication

07:01.630 --> 07:02.430
again.

07:03.000 --> 07:04.510
I haven't gotten a chance

07:04.920 --> 07:06.040
to rub Master's cheeks.

07:07.270 --> 07:08.070
Well,

07:09.750 --> 07:10.720
do you think Master

07:10.720 --> 07:11.830
likes me back?

07:14.950 --> 07:16.230
If someone takes

07:16.680 --> 07:17.750
just one more step forward,

07:18.600 --> 07:20.070
everything will be different.

07:21.410 --> 07:22.560
But that step

07:23.270 --> 07:24.630
happens to be the hardest to take.

07:27.190 --> 07:28.000
You are getting back

07:28.020 --> 07:28.990
more and more memories.

07:30.360 --> 07:31.450
You will finally recall

07:31.480 --> 07:32.510
everything from the past.

07:34.460 --> 07:35.710
Good times never last long.

07:37.000 --> 07:38.040
Why don't I indulge myself

07:39.159 --> 07:39.920
for just one time?

09:13.790 --> 09:14.320
Stiffly Su,

09:14.840 --> 09:15.480
your emotions are all stirred up.

09:15.510 --> 09:16.390
What are you trying to do?

09:17.100 --> 09:18.700
I know this is not a wise decision.

09:19.740 --> 09:21.030
That said,

09:22.000 --> 09:23.120
I still want to do it.

09:24.790 --> 09:25.600
But the effort you've put into practicing the Ice Lotus Technique

09:25.600 --> 09:26.370
will go down the drain.

09:26.750 --> 09:27.200
Then what will you have

09:27.200 --> 09:28.080
to seal the Spirit Spring with?

09:28.410 --> 09:28.930
Your life?

09:28.960 --> 09:29.790
So what?

09:31.680 --> 09:32.480
You're crazy, crazy!

09:32.510 --> 09:33.480
You've absolutely lost your mind!

09:38.720 --> 09:39.150
I...

09:39.630 --> 09:40.750
Su Yishui!

09:41.360 --> 09:42.670
Did you just destroy my precious

09:42.670 --> 09:43.520
Teleportation Jade Pendant?

10:10.030 --> 10:11.550
That previous "Break the Galaxy" attack

10:11.990 --> 10:13.870
has drained much of my original spiritual power.

10:14.240 --> 10:15.670
Now that I've taken precautions,

10:15.870 --> 10:17.240
I'll be able to resist attacks of the same sort.

10:17.510 --> 10:18.750
But if Qingge rises to a new level,

10:19.000 --> 10:20.200
then I'll inevitably get hurt,

10:20.810 --> 10:21.810
and lose a lot of power

10:21.840 --> 10:22.670
to her.

10:23.200 --> 10:24.440
You are born

10:25.140 --> 10:26.620
to be my opponents!

10:34.480 --> 10:35.630
I've formed a Golden Core.

10:35.960 --> 10:37.150
I can be of help to Yu now!

10:48.840 --> 10:49.720
Check this out.

10:50.540 --> 10:51.570
What happened to me?

10:52.940 --> 10:55.250
You've practiced too many quick-and-dirty techniques.

10:55.510 --> 10:57.600
Various types of impure energy are repelling one another in the void

10:58.370 --> 10:59.560
and causing a backlash on your body.

10:59.790 --> 11:02.550
You must rid yourself of all the techniques.

11:00.130 --> 11:01.860
[Heavenly Sect
Doctor]

11:02.910 --> 11:03.840
Otherwise,

11:04.080 --> 11:05.750
your life will be in danger.

11:06.600 --> 11:07.200
No way!

11:07.630 --> 11:09.320
I took great pains to finally form a Golden Core.

11:09.720 --> 11:10.840
I can't give up now.

11:11.390 --> 11:12.120
Tell me

11:12.720 --> 11:13.910
what else I can do!

11:16.720 --> 11:17.480
Well,

11:19.030 --> 11:21.000
the other option is for you to use another person's spiritual power

11:21.270 --> 11:22.960
to suppress the impure energy in your body.

11:24.000 --> 11:24.910
But this...

11:25.270 --> 11:27.080
is practically demonic cultivation.

11:36.240 --> 11:37.000
You...

11:38.150 --> 11:39.550
hate your sister.

11:42.630 --> 11:44.360
I just want her to disappear.

11:44.870 --> 11:45.910
With her around,

11:46.550 --> 11:48.200
people will never notice me.

11:49.080 --> 11:50.320
I must beat her down.

11:50.840 --> 11:52.630
Your Golden Core is falling apart.

11:52.750 --> 11:54.030
Your life is in danger.

11:54.270 --> 11:55.600
How can you beat your sister down?

11:57.090 --> 11:58.590
Then what should I do?a

11:59.510 --> 12:01.080
If you absorb her spiritual power,

12:01.910 --> 12:03.120
you will survive.

12:03.960 --> 12:04.670
Don't worry.

12:05.440 --> 12:06.970
I'll make you stronger.

12:10.960 --> 12:11.990
This Soul-Devouring Lock

12:12.390 --> 12:13.720
will help you get

12:14.030 --> 12:15.750
whatever she has.

12:16.910 --> 12:17.600
In this life,

12:17.630 --> 12:19.390
everything is already mine.

12:20.000 --> 12:21.720
I won't let you take anything from me again!

12:28.000 --> 12:28.550
The Resentment Liquid...

12:29.080 --> 12:30.150
Because of my unstable spiritual power,

12:30.360 --> 12:31.440
the Resentment Liquid is acting up.

12:32.150 --> 12:32.830
But Su Yishui

12:33.030 --> 12:34.200
has solved this problem for me, hasn't he?

12:37.870 --> 12:39.000
You're not half bad.

12:39.510 --> 12:41.270
The Resentment Liquid in you has been suppressed for a year.

12:41.790 --> 12:43.360
Too bad that you can't escape your fate.

12:45.270 --> 12:46.620
If you don't want to suffer,

12:47.200 --> 12:48.390
come to meet me immediately.

12:58.080 --> 12:58.750
Mu Qingge,

12:59.600 --> 13:00.720
we're finally meeting again.

13:02.320 --> 13:03.870
We're friends, Sovereign Wei.

13:04.750 --> 13:05.670
There's no reason for me not to meet you.

13:07.960 --> 13:09.030
You have never

13:09.030 --> 13:09.840
taken me seriously.

13:10.280 --> 13:10.880
But now,

13:10.910 --> 13:12.390
you're saying we're friends.

13:14.440 --> 13:15.150
Indeed,

13:16.030 --> 13:17.550
the Resentment Liquid works better than anything.

13:18.940 --> 13:19.790
Back on Mount Absolute,

13:19.870 --> 13:20.750
I did mean to be cooperative

13:21.150 --> 13:22.390
when you set up that formation,

13:23.240 --> 13:24.440
but I was held back by too many concerns.

13:25.120 --> 13:26.440
We could have had a discussion.

13:27.360 --> 13:28.960
Why did you have to resort to the Resentment Liquid?

13:31.200 --> 13:33.320
At that time, you were so righteous and tough.

13:33.600 --> 13:34.320
It looked like

13:34.550 --> 13:36.550
you and the Heavenly Sect were about to execute me.

13:37.550 --> 13:39.200
I didn't know we could've had a discussion.

13:39.360 --> 13:39.750
Fine.

13:41.480 --> 13:42.510
What would you like to discuss?

13:45.200 --> 13:46.440
Like how to spend a wonderful night with me?

13:48.750 --> 13:49.550
You're a sovereign.

13:50.670 --> 13:51.840
Why are you making a joke like that?

13:55.080 --> 13:57.240
You think I'm joking?

13:58.720 --> 13:59.910
In your previous life, back in the capital,

13:59.930 --> 14:01.240
you humiliated me in front of so many people.

14:01.960 --> 14:03.550
Today, I'll make you pay for it!

14:04.030 --> 14:04.550
Come on!

14:05.000 --> 14:05.670
Beg me.

14:06.320 --> 14:07.670
Then I'll free you from the Resentment Liquid.

14:08.200 --> 14:08.790
No!

14:09.120 --> 14:10.200
I've never seen

14:10.630 --> 14:12.120
Mu Qingge beg anyone.

14:14.840 --> 14:15.670
I'll give you what you asked!

14:18.510 --> 14:18.910
What?

14:20.120 --> 14:21.720
But I need the deal to be documented!

14:28.390 --> 14:29.200
What's wrong with you?

14:29.750 --> 14:31.240
I just got it started and you've already surrendered?

14:32.440 --> 14:33.410
In this new life of yours,

14:33.430 --> 14:34.360
it's no fun to fight you at all.

14:35.030 --> 14:35.750
So boring.

14:36.720 --> 14:37.910
So you're just toying with me.

14:39.320 --> 14:40.170
Then the Resentment Liquid in me...

14:40.840 --> 14:42.440
If you do want to get rid of it,

14:42.750 --> 14:44.790
you'll have to do my bidding from now on.

14:47.390 --> 14:47.790
Sovereign,

14:49.270 --> 14:50.840
I've only received a small portion of memories and spiritual power

14:51.240 --> 14:52.200
from the previous life.

14:52.790 --> 14:54.000
I'm afraid I won't be of help to you.

14:55.080 --> 14:56.960
You sure love making excuses, don't you?

14:57.320 --> 14:58.390
I'm not lying to you!

15:04.630 --> 15:05.510
Soul-Devouring Lock?

15:07.510 --> 15:09.200
The Reincarnation Tree bore two pieces of fruit.

15:09.600 --> 15:10.390
The other one

15:11.030 --> 15:12.440
should be my sister, Mu Ranwu.

15:14.030 --> 15:15.200
The fact that this Soul-Devouring Lock exists

15:16.360 --> 15:17.480
means she is still alive.

15:18.270 --> 15:19.080
I just don't know

15:19.100 --> 15:20.650
her identity and whereabouts in this life.

15:21.380 --> 15:22.290
But she did take away

15:22.320 --> 15:23.390
part of my spiritual power and memories.

15:23.720 --> 15:25.240
The other piece of Reincarnation Fruit is still alive?

15:27.840 --> 15:28.870
Her spiritual sense is ruined,

15:29.390 --> 15:30.200
and she's dead!

15:31.670 --> 15:32.600
You've ruined my plan!

15:33.630 --> 15:35.080
Smokescreen...

15:37.960 --> 15:40.240
It's so vicious and foolish of your little sister.

15:40.550 --> 15:42.200
If she had used the Soul-Devouring Lock

15:42.320 --> 15:43.360
with caution,

15:43.510 --> 15:44.510
she wouldn't have hurt herself.

15:45.240 --> 15:45.960
Anyway,

15:46.240 --> 15:48.080
about the Spirit Spring I'm looking for

15:48.270 --> 15:49.750
and the fruit you're searching for,

15:50.900 --> 15:52.810
we can discover clues from one person.

15:53.600 --> 15:54.960
You mean Su Yishui?

15:56.000 --> 15:56.870
The Reincarnation Tree

15:57.080 --> 15:58.630
was formed by his Golden Core after all.

15:59.080 --> 16:00.600
If the other piece of fruit is alive,

16:01.150 --> 16:02.390
he sure knows something about it.

16:04.150 --> 16:05.480
Now that we've talked about all that,

16:06.120 --> 16:07.630
you'd better agree to partner with me.

16:08.550 --> 16:09.360
Or do you think

16:09.510 --> 16:10.840
you have a better choice?

16:11.870 --> 16:12.840
I am ready

16:14.080 --> 16:15.030
to do your bidding, Sovereign.

16:19.120 --> 16:19.480
By the way,

16:20.790 --> 16:21.720
the Crown Prince

16:22.200 --> 16:23.150
has doubts about you.

16:37.080 --> 16:38.630
Yu has sent someone to stalk me.

16:39.320 --> 16:40.600
He has found me suspicious, hasn't he?

16:42.790 --> 16:43.480
Qingge,

16:44.480 --> 16:45.550
I will find you and kill you

16:45.550 --> 16:46.910
before the truth is revealed.

16:47.750 --> 16:49.550
Yu can only be mine.

17:06.069 --> 17:06.829
Master,

17:07.680 --> 17:08.640
did you tell me to come here

17:09.000 --> 17:10.920
because the Spirit Dispelling Formation has lost its effects

17:11.510 --> 17:13.000
and you want me to return to Mount Wester?

17:14.270 --> 17:14.920
I know

17:15.270 --> 17:17.109
we've all had a good rest.

17:17.400 --> 17:17.960
Next,

17:17.960 --> 17:19.310
you're going to meet your friend

17:19.550 --> 17:21.589
and try to find clues about the Seven Evil Transformation Spell.

17:22.480 --> 17:22.829
But...

17:23.359 --> 17:24.319
I want to go with you

17:24.349 --> 17:25.960
to find out where the Spirit Spring is.

17:26.640 --> 17:27.880
This is the only way I can

17:28.160 --> 17:29.510
put Madam Wu's matter behind.

17:29.680 --> 17:30.440
Are you done talking?

17:34.790 --> 17:35.640
I asked you to come

17:35.880 --> 17:36.920
because of the scenery here.

17:36.920 --> 17:37.750
There used to be resentment at Wangxiang Pass.

17:38.350 --> 17:39.400
Now that the resentment is gone,

17:39.830 --> 17:41.070
this place has taken on a new look.

17:52.450 --> 17:54.610
These night mayflies can purify spiritual energy,

17:54.910 --> 17:55.950
which is good for cultivation.

17:56.200 --> 17:57.350
Moreover, this scenery

18:00.620 --> 18:01.210
is very similar to

18:01.240 --> 18:02.880
a certain marvelous auspicious cloud phenomenon in the sky.

18:03.400 --> 18:04.160
It's worth seeing.

18:04.640 --> 18:05.400
I thought

18:06.550 --> 18:07.720
you might want to see it.

18:15.680 --> 18:16.680
So beautiful.

18:21.960 --> 18:22.440
Wait.

18:22.880 --> 18:23.920
Master,

18:24.480 --> 18:25.750
you're not asking me to leave?

18:26.210 --> 18:27.520
Does it mean I can stay

18:27.550 --> 18:28.790
and adventure with you?

18:31.810 --> 18:32.460
You can stay.

18:33.100 --> 18:33.990
Thank you, Master.

18:54.400 --> 18:54.880
Ranran,

18:55.360 --> 18:56.040
I need to talk with your master

18:56.070 --> 18:57.030
about an important issue.

18:57.290 --> 18:58.370
Please go tell him I'm here.

18:58.980 --> 19:00.460
Master Mu, you're a brutal killer.

19:00.650 --> 19:01.780
I don't want anything to do with you.

19:02.360 --> 19:03.320
You've made a big enough scene here.

19:03.750 --> 19:04.720
If my master would like to meet you,

19:04.880 --> 19:05.680
he will come out.

19:07.640 --> 19:08.510
Here are some presents.

19:08.790 --> 19:09.590
Please do us a favor.

19:11.000 --> 19:12.400
You must be Mr. Wang Suizhi.

19:12.980 --> 19:14.290
Did the former Wester Sect disciples

19:14.400 --> 19:15.790
accept bribes?

19:16.070 --> 19:16.830
Cut the nonsense!

19:17.170 --> 19:18.170
You'd better be polite,

19:18.680 --> 19:19.980
or I will take down this...

19:19.710 --> 19:20.600
[Mu Ranwu's disciple
Lin Yeting]

19:22.110 --> 19:22.960
Say what you want

19:23.350 --> 19:24.400
and do not waste my time.

19:25.750 --> 19:26.270
Shui,

19:27.040 --> 19:28.390
I have something important to tell you.

19:28.920 --> 19:29.790
Can we have a word in private?

19:30.590 --> 19:31.400
You're the only one I'd like to talk to.

19:33.160 --> 19:34.030
It's about the Reincarnation Tree.

19:37.110 --> 19:37.830
Come with me.

19:40.550 --> 19:42.750
Isn't Grandmaster in love with Mr. Yu?

19:43.510 --> 19:45.310
Why would she want a meeting with Master?

19:46.270 --> 19:46.930
Ranran,

19:47.420 --> 19:49.160
I think someone is jealous.

19:50.560 --> 19:51.560
Are you into...

19:51.590 --> 19:52.000
I...

19:52.830 --> 19:54.030
I'm going to shop for fish.

20:03.440 --> 20:04.960
What do you want to know about the Reincarnation Tree?

20:05.550 --> 20:06.590
The Reincarnation Tree

20:07.060 --> 20:08.270
actually bore two pieces of fruit,

20:09.000 --> 20:09.450
didn't it?

20:09.890 --> 20:11.240
All I did was grow it with my Golden Core.

20:11.720 --> 20:12.510
How am I supposed to know

20:12.510 --> 20:13.310
how many pieces of fruit it bore?

20:13.400 --> 20:14.030
If there was a second piece of fruit,

20:14.880 --> 20:15.720
you would know best

20:15.750 --> 20:16.640
since you grew on the same tree, right?

20:17.310 --> 20:18.680
Before I was born,

20:19.240 --> 20:20.000
I had sensed the existence

20:20.030 --> 20:20.920
of another piece of fruit.

20:22.510 --> 20:23.440
That sounds odd.

20:23.830 --> 20:24.720
What little spiritual power I had

20:25.070 --> 20:26.400
could only support one person's reincarnation.

20:26.860 --> 20:27.990
You've turned out well.

20:28.320 --> 20:28.970
That means you must have absorbed

20:29.000 --> 20:29.960
most of the spiritual power.

20:30.420 --> 20:31.350
If there was another girl,

20:31.920 --> 20:33.000
could she have survived?

20:33.720 --> 20:34.590
So you know nothing about it?

20:35.110 --> 20:36.000
I'm not interested in it, either.

20:36.640 --> 20:37.790
The curse between me and Mount Wester has been lifted.

20:38.120 --> 20:39.010
I have nothing to do with any other issue.

20:39.510 --> 20:40.200
Goodbye.

20:40.920 --> 20:41.320
Hold on!

20:42.190 --> 20:43.710
A year ago, you rid me of the Resentment Liquid.

20:44.270 --> 20:45.510
Why is it acting up again?

20:46.730 --> 20:48.250
The Resentment Liquid has stronger Yin energy

20:48.440 --> 20:49.160
than any other thing in the universe.

20:49.550 --> 20:51.200
It was formed after years of fermentation in the Abysmal Abyss.

20:51.900 --> 20:52.810
I'm only able to suppress it,

20:52.880 --> 20:53.640
not to completely eliminate it.

20:55.720 --> 20:56.960
I didn't make it clear back then,

20:57.830 --> 20:58.720
but now I've explained it to you.

20:59.550 --> 21:00.520
A temporary fix will do.

21:00.590 --> 21:01.760
I'm feeling so much pain...

21:01.790 --> 21:02.720
The spiritual medicine has run out.

21:03.070 --> 21:03.920
There's nothing I can do.

21:05.110 --> 21:06.030
You should ask Yu.

21:06.280 --> 21:07.170
I bet he can give you an answer.

21:08.640 --> 21:09.200
Shui,

21:10.260 --> 21:11.550
do you still hate Yu?

21:13.340 --> 21:14.510
Actually, since my rebirth,

21:15.200 --> 21:16.440
it has always been you

21:17.110 --> 21:17.880
who I truly care about.

21:19.440 --> 21:20.160
Do you remember?

21:20.880 --> 21:22.200
In my previous life, when my hand was injured,

21:22.510 --> 21:23.440
You made an ointment for me.

21:23.750 --> 21:24.960
Your innermost thoughts

21:25.270 --> 21:26.070
are no secret to me.

21:26.440 --> 21:27.640
You should have told me earlier.

21:34.530 --> 21:36.100
You must be having a misunderstanding.

21:36.960 --> 21:38.400
As you said, that happened in your previous life.

21:39.070 --> 21:40.440
It has nothing to do with this life of yours.

21:41.240 --> 21:42.830
You're lucky to have started a new life, so cherish it.

21:43.480 --> 21:44.240
Don't let down those

21:44.270 --> 21:45.590
who wish you well.

21:48.160 --> 21:49.640
Are you gonna sit back and watch

21:49.790 --> 21:50.860
the Resentment Liquid kill me?

21:53.110 --> 21:54.030
You've always been a resourceful woman.

21:54.680 --> 21:55.790
You would do

21:56.030 --> 21:57.000
whatever it takes

21:57.030 --> 21:58.000
to get what you want.

21:58.750 --> 21:59.640
Since this is a life-threatening problem,

22:00.200 --> 22:01.480
I believe you'll find a cure.

22:07.010 --> 22:08.530
Am I wrong about

22:09.070 --> 22:11.160
his feelings for Qingge in the previous life,

22:12.310 --> 22:13.310
or is it true

22:14.140 --> 22:16.100
that Qingge has been hidden by him?

22:18.350 --> 22:19.350
Now that this is the case,

22:20.000 --> 22:22.160
I hope you won't blame me for teaming up with Wei Jiu.

22:25.060 --> 22:25.710
Sir,

22:26.070 --> 22:27.480
why are you closing business so early?

22:28.160 --> 22:28.640
Miss,

22:29.010 --> 22:30.160
I usually sell fish in the morning.

22:30.240 --> 22:31.350
Today's fish have sold out by now.

22:33.110 --> 22:33.720
Okay.

22:36.160 --> 22:36.590
Ranran.

22:39.400 --> 22:40.320
Mr. Yu.

22:41.950 --> 22:42.860
Do you want to buy fish?

22:44.750 --> 22:45.550
Come aboard my boat.

22:46.400 --> 22:47.680
I'm going to check the waterways at Wangxiang Pass.

22:47.880 --> 22:48.920
I can take you to the middle of the river

22:48.920 --> 22:49.830
where you can catch some fresh fish.

22:50.720 --> 22:51.550
Thank you, Mr. Yu.

22:52.440 --> 22:52.960
Let's go.

23:03.110 --> 23:05.590
Mr. Yu is sure handsome,

23:06.150 --> 23:07.520
but Master is more charming

23:07.720 --> 23:09.350
owing to his unworldly face.

23:11.480 --> 23:12.030
Ranran,

23:13.830 --> 23:14.720
listen,

23:15.550 --> 23:16.550
I have an old friend

23:17.350 --> 23:18.200
who I had missed dearly

23:19.200 --> 23:20.200
but hadn't seen in years.

23:21.310 --> 23:22.510
I racked my brains to find a way

23:23.110 --> 23:24.110
to reunite with her.

23:24.920 --> 23:26.030
But when I met her again,

23:28.000 --> 23:30.070
I felt despondent.

23:30.820 --> 23:31.990
It is odd, isn't it?

23:32.880 --> 23:34.310
The friend you're talking about

23:34.350 --> 23:35.400
is Master Mu, right?

23:38.960 --> 23:39.750
I shouldn't share

23:40.240 --> 23:41.350
such kind of things with others.

23:41.720 --> 23:42.750
I don't know why,

23:43.510 --> 23:44.590
but I always find myself telling you my thoughts

23:44.590 --> 23:45.270
without realizing it.

23:46.880 --> 23:47.830
Confiding your troubles to someone

23:47.950 --> 23:49.030
would make you feel better.

23:49.480 --> 23:49.890
Just speak your mind.

23:50.340 --> 23:51.130
I'll be a good listener.

23:52.480 --> 23:53.240
When I was young,

23:53.750 --> 23:55.280
I went with my father to provide famine relief.

23:55.650 --> 23:56.780
We helped many people.

23:57.520 --> 23:58.650
Only a little girl

23:58.680 --> 23:59.550
said she'd repay me.

24:00.030 --> 24:00.900
In those chaotic times,

24:01.510 --> 24:03.000
anyone's survival would be a miracle.

24:03.790 --> 24:05.590
So I didn't take her promise seriously at the time.

24:06.200 --> 24:06.920
Unexpectedly,

24:07.960 --> 24:08.640
eight years after that,

24:09.880 --> 24:10.640
she did show up.

24:13.440 --> 24:14.110
Later on,

24:15.000 --> 24:16.110
the Spirit Spring appeared,

24:17.110 --> 24:18.400
and I learned that she died.

24:19.350 --> 24:20.680
In the 18 years after her death,

24:22.090 --> 24:23.270
I kept paying annual visits to Mount Absolute

24:23.270 --> 24:24.750
for any news about the Reincarnation Tree.

24:25.720 --> 24:27.160
I swore a million times

24:27.510 --> 24:29.200
that if I could start it all over again,

24:30.830 --> 24:32.830
I would protect Qingge with all my might.

24:33.200 --> 24:33.790
Fortunately,

24:34.310 --> 24:35.830
Master Mu has come back to life now.

24:36.590 --> 24:37.270
Yes.

24:38.680 --> 24:39.880
Qingge is back and alive now.

24:40.920 --> 24:42.000
But for some reason,

24:42.590 --> 24:43.440
I feel

24:44.480 --> 24:45.680
that she is different from before.

24:49.270 --> 24:50.480
Perhaps that's what happens when one's dream

24:50.790 --> 24:52.160
finally comes true after years of waiting.

24:52.720 --> 24:53.960
But what does it matter?

24:54.320 --> 24:55.560
All is fine as long as you and Master Mu

24:55.590 --> 24:56.790
care about each other.

24:57.240 --> 24:58.790
Life is uneventful in its nature.

24:59.300 --> 25:00.750
Maybe after a while, you'll realize

25:00.960 --> 25:01.680
that simple companionship

25:01.750 --> 25:03.110
is the most precious.

25:07.220 --> 25:07.970
You're right.

25:09.960 --> 25:10.350
Ranran,

25:12.160 --> 25:12.830
thank you.

25:14.200 --> 25:14.880
Anytime.

25:15.000 --> 25:15.880
We're friends, remember?

25:19.910 --> 25:20.560
Your Highness,

25:20.590 --> 25:21.510
these are freshly caught fish.

25:22.640 --> 25:23.960
Why don't I make a novel dish

25:24.070 --> 25:25.070
to cheer you up?

25:26.070 --> 25:26.590
Okay.

25:30.790 --> 25:32.240
This is my chance to try cooking this dish.

25:32.680 --> 25:33.920
I'll make it again for Master back home.

25:40.880 --> 25:41.720
Here comes the final step.

25:50.070 --> 25:50.790
This dish

25:50.880 --> 25:52.070
is called "Getting Drunk in River in Broad Daylight."

25:52.270 --> 25:53.680
I learned it from the Collection of Entertainment.

25:53.960 --> 25:54.550
The Collection of Entertainment?

26:01.030 --> 26:01.640
This is...

26:02.480 --> 26:03.640
Qingge's handwriting.

26:04.070 --> 26:04.680
I

26:05.000 --> 26:07.030
discovered it in Mount Wester.

26:07.200 --> 26:08.640
Master said I could keep it.

26:09.510 --> 26:10.350
Mr. Yu,

26:10.480 --> 26:12.160
you won't give it to Master Mu, will you?

26:14.200 --> 26:14.750
I won't.

26:16.030 --> 26:17.000
That's a relief!

26:17.310 --> 26:18.800
It records so much fun stuff.

26:18.830 --> 26:19.790
This is my own treasure chest.

26:20.790 --> 26:21.680
Su Yishui

26:22.550 --> 26:23.830
said you could keep it?

26:24.680 --> 26:25.160
Yes.

26:26.000 --> 26:26.920
This book contains

26:26.920 --> 26:28.310
much of Su Yishui's past.

26:28.880 --> 26:30.000
It's unusual for him

26:30.750 --> 26:31.920
to give it away. What changed him?

26:32.240 --> 26:32.960
Mr. Yu.

26:33.880 --> 26:34.550
Mr. Yu?

26:36.200 --> 26:37.400
Aren't you gonna give it back to me?

26:44.760 --> 26:46.180
Your master is very nice to you.

26:46.550 --> 26:47.400
Of course.

26:48.720 --> 26:49.720
But sometimes

26:49.880 --> 26:50.750
he is very harsh.

26:51.400 --> 26:52.350
Would he be harsh on you?

26:52.680 --> 26:53.590
Sure thing.

26:53.890 --> 26:55.040
When I was new to Mount Wester,

26:55.070 --> 26:56.030
he punished me quite often.

26:56.590 --> 26:57.160
Nonetheless,

26:57.310 --> 26:58.570
since I got the Collection of Entertainment,

26:58.800 --> 26:59.800
I've figured out quite a few ways

26:59.830 --> 27:00.750
to please Master.

27:01.110 --> 27:02.590
Part of the writing is inaccurate, though.

27:02.830 --> 27:03.440
For example,

27:03.510 --> 27:04.810
the salt-preserved dried longan written in it

27:04.880 --> 27:05.720
doesn't appeal to his appetite.

27:06.680 --> 27:07.680
Salt-preserved dried longan

27:08.160 --> 27:09.440
is popular among poor people.

27:09.920 --> 27:11.030
Its sweetness is too light

27:11.680 --> 27:13.110
compared to its sourness and bitterness.

27:13.750 --> 27:15.200
I think that's the kind of snack his mother made him

27:15.400 --> 27:16.680
before he moved to Prince Ping's residence.

27:22.070 --> 27:23.480
Now I understand why there was dried longan

27:23.640 --> 27:24.790
beside his swaddling cloth.

27:25.550 --> 27:26.480
Your Master was sold

27:26.480 --> 27:27.830
to Prince Ping's residence by his own mother.

27:27.960 --> 27:28.880
Judging from his temperament,

27:29.200 --> 27:30.440
he takes dried longan with him

27:30.590 --> 27:32.150
so it can constantly remind him

27:32.510 --> 27:33.310
to achieve more than most others

27:33.830 --> 27:34.640
and to seek revenge.

27:35.510 --> 27:36.030
No.

27:36.440 --> 27:37.310
I think

27:37.440 --> 27:38.450
Master values

27:38.480 --> 27:39.550
this mother-son relationship more than anyone.

27:42.070 --> 27:43.590
You seem to know a lot about your master.

27:44.880 --> 27:45.830
Let's change the topic.

27:46.240 --> 27:46.790
Mr. Yu,

27:46.960 --> 27:47.720
have some fish soup.

27:54.510 --> 27:55.200
Surprisingly,

27:56.070 --> 27:56.640
the soup she made

27:56.640 --> 27:57.920
tastes the same as that made by Qingge.

27:58.400 --> 27:59.400
So does the wine she brewed.

28:00.640 --> 28:01.110
Ranran,

28:02.110 --> 28:03.030
we've known each other for a long time,

28:03.550 --> 28:04.720
but I haven't heard much

28:04.720 --> 28:05.350
about your story.

28:06.640 --> 28:07.550
Tell me more about yourself.

28:12.890 --> 28:14.110
The fish you cooked is delicious.

28:14.510 --> 28:15.720
I had great fun today.

28:16.110 --> 28:17.110
Next time when you come to the capital,

28:17.350 --> 28:18.640
don't forget to visit me in the royal palace.

28:18.920 --> 28:19.790
I would love to

28:20.070 --> 28:20.830
show you a good time.

28:32.680 --> 28:33.400
Miss, hold on!

28:35.070 --> 28:36.000
This is a gift from His Highness.

28:36.270 --> 28:37.020
It's token of appreciation.

28:37.350 --> 28:38.160
Please do take it.

28:39.120 --> 28:39.690
No need for this.

28:39.720 --> 28:40.880
I only made some ordinary dishes.

28:41.070 --> 28:42.110
Mr. Yu doesn't need to give me a gift.

28:42.710 --> 28:43.660
Miss, just do me favor and accept it.

28:43.960 --> 28:45.070
You solved a major case for the military.

28:45.350 --> 28:46.070
For that,

28:46.290 --> 28:46.970
we already owe you a lot.

28:47.200 --> 28:47.830
Or do you

28:47.920 --> 28:49.200
actually want something else?

28:50.070 --> 28:50.790
Alright, alright.

28:52.520 --> 28:53.040
Thank you.

29:07.510 --> 29:08.160
Yu,

29:08.960 --> 29:10.110
it is late at night now.

29:10.470 --> 29:11.270
How can I help you?

29:11.970 --> 29:12.690
Previously, I asked you

29:12.720 --> 29:13.550
to make a Health Pill

29:13.570 --> 29:14.460
to boost my father's health.

29:14.720 --> 29:15.790
It has been over a year.

29:16.160 --> 29:16.750
Have you finished it yet?

29:19.030 --> 29:19.920
I'll go get it right now.

29:32.060 --> 29:33.170
I've completed the inspection of the waterways

29:33.200 --> 29:34.240
at Wangxiang Pass today.

29:34.480 --> 29:35.920
We'll set out for the next destination tomorrow.

29:36.270 --> 29:37.030
You should have a good rest.

29:40.720 --> 29:41.570
It just came to my mind

29:41.830 --> 29:43.160
that I have a personal affair to deal with.

29:43.680 --> 29:45.160
I'm afraid I can't be with you tomorrow.

29:45.640 --> 29:46.510
When it's done,

29:46.790 --> 29:47.720
I'll come find you.

29:49.550 --> 29:49.960
Okay.

29:52.200 --> 29:52.830
How is the quality?

29:54.920 --> 29:56.030
The lowest kind.

29:57.600 --> 29:58.790
Due to unstable power?

29:59.110 --> 30:00.310
It has nothing to do with power.

30:00.480 --> 30:02.000
Poor talent is the reason.

30:07.550 --> 30:08.030
Your Highness,

30:08.310 --> 30:09.270
we got some news from the capital.

30:09.750 --> 30:11.070
Someone cast a Nightmare Curse on Concubine Zhou.

30:11.550 --> 30:12.720
If it weren't for the protective jade,

30:12.920 --> 30:14.510
she might have been killed.

30:15.550 --> 30:16.230
Who did it?

30:17.110 --> 30:18.350
It was Madam Mu's order.

30:19.130 --> 30:20.130
Maybe Madam Mu

30:20.160 --> 30:21.250
cares too much about Your Highness,

30:21.880 --> 30:23.070
so she got jealous of Concubine Zhou

30:23.830 --> 30:24.720
and took extreme action.

30:25.200 --> 30:25.750
Besides...

30:26.160 --> 30:26.680
Besides what?

30:27.660 --> 30:28.970
I saw Madam Mu meet

30:29.000 --> 30:30.200
with the demonic cultivator Wei Jiu today.

30:30.510 --> 30:31.640
But I don't know what that was for.

30:37.400 --> 30:37.920
I see.

30:38.550 --> 30:39.720
Inspecting all the waterways

30:40.110 --> 30:41.240
is our top priority.

30:41.830 --> 30:42.920
Anything else can wait.

30:43.510 --> 30:44.510
Keep doing your job of protecting Qingge.

30:45.310 --> 30:45.750
Yes.

30:50.350 --> 30:51.360
After several days of care,

30:51.450 --> 30:52.790
you've finally expelled some poison out of your system.

30:52.960 --> 30:53.900
You need to take some more pills,

30:53.960 --> 30:54.590
and get more rest.

30:56.730 --> 30:58.320
Our master's friend who knows about talismans

30:58.350 --> 30:59.160
is in Mount Cuiwei.

30:59.480 --> 31:01.400
God knows how many days this trip will take.

31:07.750 --> 31:08.240
Let's go.

31:08.350 --> 31:08.750
Yes.

31:09.160 --> 31:09.830
Master,

31:10.040 --> 31:11.210
aren't we gonna say goodbye

31:11.240 --> 31:11.960
to Mr. Yu?

31:13.510 --> 31:14.240
He already left.

31:14.890 --> 31:15.780
He didn't, did he?

31:15.920 --> 31:16.790
Just now, I saw

31:16.790 --> 31:17.640
the Crown Prince's flag

31:17.640 --> 31:18.680
hoisted at the camp entrance.

31:20.890 --> 31:22.080
What about Mr. Qin?

31:22.110 --> 31:22.750
Come on. Just go.

31:29.510 --> 31:31.150
[Leisure]

31:38.720 --> 31:39.960
This is Mount Cuiwei, isn't it?

31:41.260 --> 31:42.740
What a beautiful place!

31:43.690 --> 31:45.240
I'm curious about Master's

31:45.260 --> 31:46.190
mystery friend.

31:47.270 --> 31:48.720
Su Yishui requests a meeting with Alcohol Immortal.

31:51.200 --> 31:51.750
Who?

31:53.070 --> 31:53.750
Su Yishui.

31:56.720 --> 31:57.830
Su Yishui is a punk.

31:57.920 --> 31:58.640
Your request is denied!

31:59.830 --> 32:00.510
Master,

32:01.200 --> 32:02.130
is this friend of yours

32:02.270 --> 32:03.720
feuding with you?

32:05.300 --> 32:06.860
He often drank alcohol with Mu Qingge in her last life.

32:07.450 --> 32:08.690
He's the world's top talisman guru.

32:09.270 --> 32:09.920
This is bad.

32:10.590 --> 32:11.720
He is not really a friend of Master's,

32:12.090 --> 32:13.280
but Grandmaster's.

32:14.000 --> 32:15.550
I don't think he'll let us in.

32:17.640 --> 32:18.640
Mr. Alcohol Immortal,

32:19.070 --> 32:20.150
my master is asking to meet you

32:20.270 --> 32:21.310
because there are demons hurting people.

32:21.310 --> 32:22.200
He is not here for a personal affair.

32:26.840 --> 32:27.930
My grandmaster Mu Qingge

32:27.960 --> 32:29.070
has already reincarnated and started a new life.

32:29.270 --> 32:30.480
We saw her yesterday.

32:30.750 --> 32:32.150
Why do you have to dwell on the past?

32:32.750 --> 32:34.030
Forget it, Ranran.

32:34.590 --> 32:35.680
A drunkard like him

32:36.080 --> 32:37.040
probably can't hear

32:37.070 --> 32:38.160
anything you say.

32:47.550 --> 32:48.350
Such a failure!

32:48.720 --> 32:49.400
Failure!

32:50.400 --> 32:51.840
Your name is Alcohol Immortal,

32:51.920 --> 32:53.720
but the wine you brewed is not as good as Mistaken Divine.

32:54.310 --> 32:55.270
What a failure!

32:58.750 --> 33:00.160
You've tasted Mistaken Divine?

33:00.510 --> 33:01.340
I've not only tasted it,

33:01.440 --> 33:02.350
but I also know how to make it.

33:03.790 --> 33:04.400
Try some.

33:13.030 --> 33:13.440
Yes!

33:14.110 --> 33:15.200
It is Mistaken Divine.

33:17.960 --> 33:18.880
And it's freshly brewed!

33:18.960 --> 33:19.360
You...

33:21.160 --> 33:22.110
Where did you get this?

33:22.160 --> 33:23.310
As you said, it's freshly brewed.

33:23.350 --> 33:24.510
This is my creation, of course.

33:24.920 --> 33:25.550
That's impossible!

33:26.240 --> 33:26.880
I dare you

33:27.270 --> 33:28.200
write me the recipe!

33:29.720 --> 33:30.270
Easy peasy.

33:30.680 --> 33:31.640
My master

33:31.750 --> 33:32.750
would like a meeting with you.

33:33.030 --> 33:33.830
If you agree to meet him,

33:34.070 --> 33:35.160
I'll not only give you the recipe,

33:35.340 --> 33:36.210
but also help you

33:36.240 --> 33:37.160
brew a jar of Mistaken Divine.

33:37.830 --> 33:39.240
But if you disagree,

33:39.880 --> 33:41.200
I'll have to leave with my master.

33:45.720 --> 33:46.200
Come on in!

33:47.510 --> 33:48.240
Thank you, sir!

33:49.200 --> 33:49.590
Speak your mind.

33:59.110 --> 34:00.240
The Seven Evil Transformation Spell?

34:01.830 --> 34:02.790
How did you get it?

34:03.590 --> 34:05.200
Someone at Wangxiang Pass was cursed by this spell.

34:05.910 --> 34:07.670
There was resentment around the waterways.

34:08.190 --> 34:08.630
I guess

34:08.880 --> 34:09.800
it was done by the Spirit Spring

34:10.440 --> 34:11.360
when it made an attempt to break the seal.

34:15.510 --> 34:16.030
Years ago,

34:16.480 --> 34:17.840
you people killed Mu

34:18.679 --> 34:19.889
and the Spirit Spring went missing.

34:20.710 --> 34:21.920
If it still exists in the mortal world,

34:22.440 --> 34:23.670
it could've done what you said

34:24.480 --> 34:25.590
though many years have passed.

34:27.330 --> 34:28.199
The Spirit Spring infused the river

34:28.230 --> 34:29.440
with resentment,

34:30.190 --> 34:31.550
found those holding grudges,

34:32.030 --> 34:33.510
and demonized them with the Seven Evil Transformation Spell,

34:34.010 --> 34:34.969
so they could kill innocent people for the spring

34:35.000 --> 34:35.760
and accumulate more resentment.

34:36.840 --> 34:38.190
It's the Mortal-Demon Lord's tactic.

34:39.080 --> 34:40.770
You're good-looking

34:40.800 --> 34:41.630
and smart.

34:42.199 --> 34:43.760
It's no wonder Mu would fall for your trick.

34:45.139 --> 34:46.100
Now that you've solved

34:46.130 --> 34:47.210
most of the puzzle,

34:47.670 --> 34:48.800
why would you want to meet me?

34:51.360 --> 34:52.510
I only know the Spirit Spring's purpose,

34:52.989 --> 34:54.139
but not its location.

34:54.520 --> 34:55.370
I came here to ask you

34:55.400 --> 34:56.550
to track down the Spirit Spring

34:56.710 --> 34:57.760
based on this Seven Evil Transformation Spell.

34:58.480 --> 34:59.320
There isn't a useful lead.

35:00.000 --> 35:00.710
This spell alone

35:00.840 --> 35:02.360
can't help me find out who cast the curse.

35:05.190 --> 35:05.760
That said,

35:06.280 --> 35:07.360
I do have an idea.

35:07.400 --> 35:08.030
What idea?

35:08.670 --> 35:09.960
The Spirit Spring is related to Mu.

35:10.360 --> 35:11.880
Something with her spiritual energy attached

35:12.030 --> 35:12.990
could lead us

35:13.070 --> 35:13.960
to the Spirit Spring.

35:17.480 --> 35:18.000
Sir,

35:18.330 --> 35:19.330
I brewed a new pot of Mistaken Divine.

35:19.800 --> 35:20.480
Already?

35:21.280 --> 35:22.150
I have my own way.

35:26.630 --> 35:27.260
Master,

35:27.510 --> 35:28.150
how is it going?

35:29.510 --> 35:31.110
The Spirit Spring is sealed by her Golden Core.

35:31.880 --> 35:32.550
Perhaps

35:33.110 --> 35:34.510
she can sense the Spirit Spring.

35:35.670 --> 35:36.320
But...

35:37.360 --> 35:37.800
Anyway,

35:38.360 --> 35:39.510
our lives have been entangled.

35:39.880 --> 35:41.400
Maybe I should end this with her

35:41.880 --> 35:42.800
so I can put all the worries behind sooner.

35:44.480 --> 35:45.030
Alcohol Immortal,

35:45.890 --> 35:46.770
please allow the two of us

35:46.800 --> 35:47.840
to stay a few days here.

35:49.280 --> 35:50.630
You're really pushing your luck, lad.

35:51.630 --> 35:52.150
Sir,

35:52.400 --> 35:53.190
if you let us stay,

35:53.410 --> 35:54.330
I'll make you

35:54.360 --> 35:55.070
whatever you want to drink.

35:58.710 --> 36:00.190
You're so luck to have this disciple.

36:12.000 --> 36:13.080
Master, are you saying

36:13.110 --> 36:14.320
that I can sense the Spirit Spring?

36:16.750 --> 36:18.020
When Mu Qingge sealed the Spirit Spring,

36:18.510 --> 36:19.800
a trail of her spiritual power was left.

36:20.440 --> 36:21.710
She and you grew on the same tree.

36:21.800 --> 36:22.840
Your spiritual power and hers were connected.

36:23.320 --> 36:24.320
Maybe you can also sense the spring.

36:25.440 --> 36:27.360
When Master mentioned Mu Qingge,

36:27.590 --> 36:28.360
he didn't seem

36:28.360 --> 36:29.710
to be emotional.

36:33.630 --> 36:34.070
Well...

36:34.880 --> 36:36.470
Master, tell me how to sense it.

36:37.150 --> 36:38.480
Show the tree now.

36:44.360 --> 36:45.360
I will protect you

36:45.820 --> 36:46.940
to make sure you are not interrupted

36:46.960 --> 36:47.720
when you release your spiritual power.

36:49.510 --> 36:50.360
Try your best to detect

36:50.360 --> 36:51.510
where there is the most resentment,

36:51.870 --> 36:53.350
which happens to resonate with your spiritual power.

37:09.480 --> 37:10.360
Release your spiritual power.

37:10.840 --> 37:11.590
Close your eyes to feel.

37:19.320 --> 37:20.320
Focus up and stay calm.

37:44.550 --> 37:45.480
I'm feeling it.

37:51.110 --> 37:52.230
The Spirit Spring is in the southeast.

37:53.840 --> 37:54.510
You guys

37:54.640 --> 37:56.080
were wounded by demonic poison

37:56.110 --> 37:57.030
and have not fully recovered.

37:57.440 --> 37:58.960
You should take a rest here and expel the poison.

37:59.630 --> 38:00.360
We'll set out in 5 days.

38:01.760 --> 38:02.230
Yes.

38:04.590 --> 38:05.360
About the Spirit Spring,

38:05.880 --> 38:06.920
don't tell others what we found.

38:07.510 --> 38:08.800
Or they might make hasty and wrong decisions.

38:13.030 --> 38:14.230
Is it a secret

38:14.590 --> 38:16.230
only between you and me?

38:19.360 --> 38:19.840
Yes.

38:26.090 --> 38:26.540
Let's go.

38:27.000 --> 38:27.710
It's time for practice and detoxification.

38:38.000 --> 38:38.630
Ling Xiao,

38:39.400 --> 38:40.400
Master has treated me

38:40.550 --> 38:42.070
very gently and differently these days,

38:42.590 --> 38:43.550
hasn't he?

38:44.360 --> 38:45.960
Master knows my feelings for him, right?

38:46.670 --> 38:47.560
What exactly

38:47.590 --> 38:48.880
is he thinking?

38:56.920 --> 38:58.110
That's Su Yishui's disciple.

38:58.480 --> 38:59.190
If we capture him,

38:59.280 --> 39:00.880
we'll know Su Yishui's plans.

39:03.630 --> 39:05.110
Su Yishui is cautious man.

39:05.510 --> 39:06.510
He doesn't easily disclose

39:06.630 --> 39:08.400
important matters to his disciples.

39:10.150 --> 39:11.110
Now this disciple of his

39:11.110 --> 39:12.070
is alone here.

39:12.190 --> 39:13.030
Why don't we turn him

39:13.150 --> 39:14.710
into our bait

39:15.000 --> 39:16.920
to get Su Yishui on the hook?

39:19.230 --> 39:19.840
Mu Qingge,

39:20.630 --> 39:21.630
in this new life of yours,

39:22.280 --> 39:23.760
you've become more cunning.

39:24.490 --> 39:25.680
Now you can think of ruses and scams

39:25.710 --> 39:26.550
faster than I can.

39:28.590 --> 39:30.110
We'd better go after him now.

39:35.170 --> 39:39.280
[A market at the foot of Mount Cuiwei]

39:41.710 --> 39:42.360
Go away!

39:42.500 --> 39:42.980
Hurry up!

39:43.630 --> 39:44.000
Leave!

39:45.110 --> 39:45.710
Listen up,

39:46.070 --> 39:46.890
our pawn shop

39:46.930 --> 39:47.810
is no home for

39:47.840 --> 39:48.440
crappy junk.

39:49.030 --> 39:49.480
You...

39:50.070 --> 39:51.480
This is a top-tier item for sword cultivators.

39:51.510 --> 39:52.480
It's a Sword Heart Pill!

39:52.670 --> 39:54.000
You ignorant fool!

39:54.110 --> 39:55.280
Sword Heart Pill?

40:00.590 --> 40:01.440
My friend,

40:01.850 --> 40:03.850
is it true

40:03.880 --> 40:05.440
that this is a top-tier Sword Heart Pill

40:05.460 --> 40:06.520
that helps sword cultivators

40:06.550 --> 40:07.920
quickly make progress?

40:08.400 --> 40:09.360
I can tell

40:09.840 --> 40:10.920
that you have a good eye for nice stuff.

40:11.220 --> 40:12.130
To know if the pill is true,

40:12.550 --> 40:13.630
just sniff it.

40:15.920 --> 40:17.360
I wouldn't sell it to someone else

40:17.700 --> 40:18.910
if I wasn't in desperate need of money.

40:20.150 --> 40:20.880
I believe

40:21.360 --> 40:22.770
you're a sophisticated man

40:22.800 --> 40:24.190
with many talents.

40:24.710 --> 40:26.230
I'm sure you know how good this pill is.

40:26.760 --> 40:27.950
It's fate that brought us here today.

40:28.400 --> 40:30.400
I'll only charge you 8 taels of silver

40:30.880 --> 40:31.620
for this

40:31.800 --> 40:32.550
Sword Heart Pill.

40:33.030 --> 40:34.280
I think it'll be in good hands.

40:37.880 --> 40:39.030
It is indeed a good pill.

40:39.800 --> 40:40.880
But my master forbids me

40:41.240 --> 40:42.040
from taking other pills

40:42.070 --> 40:43.280
than those made in the sect.

40:44.110 --> 40:45.800
What a shame!

40:49.320 --> 40:49.900
Give it to me.

40:50.280 --> 40:50.670
I'll buy it.

40:52.440 --> 40:53.100
It's yours now.

40:57.480 --> 40:59.110
If I eat this pill at the foot  of the mountain,

40:59.440 --> 41:01.070
Master might not figure it out.

41:19.590 --> 41:20.440
Sir...

41:22.880 --> 41:23.670
Sir...

41:28.360 --> 41:29.510
Are you okay?

41:35.800 --> 41:38.030
You're sweating a lot, sir.

41:39.710 --> 41:40.630
Sir,

41:41.110 --> 41:42.510
I have a tea house

41:43.030 --> 41:44.070
right in front.

41:44.550 --> 41:47.150
Why don't you come with me and have some tea

41:47.440 --> 41:48.520
to beat the heat?

42:29.780 --> 42:31.070
Stop stealing food!

42:32.750 --> 42:34.070
A spiritual soul is attached to this vine, right?

42:34.920 --> 42:35.590
A spiritual soul that was detached

42:35.590 --> 42:36.710
from the body over 20 years ago.

42:37.000 --> 42:37.510
How strange.

42:37.760 --> 42:38.630
Why hasn't it gone yet?

42:39.320 --> 42:40.230
What did you use to keep it alive?

42:40.840 --> 42:41.590
What are you...

42:42.030 --> 42:42.630
No, that's not right.

42:43.230 --> 42:44.670
Even if it is nourished with the Blood Chalcedony,

42:44.840 --> 42:46.360
it shouldn't have such strong energy.

42:47.360 --> 42:48.320
Could it be...

42:49.150 --> 42:49.760
Ranran!

42:50.280 --> 42:51.280
Just a misunderstanding!

42:51.590 --> 42:52.110
Calm down.

42:52.320 --> 42:52.920
Calm down.

42:54.030 --> 42:54.630
Liang Wumeng,

42:54.920 --> 42:55.640
you're injured and having a secluded session.

42:55.670 --> 42:56.440
Shouldn't you be resting and recovering

42:56.460 --> 42:57.980
instead of making a mess here?

42:58.190 --> 42:58.880
You wanna die or what?

42:59.280 --> 43:00.000
Liang Wumeng?

43:00.840 --> 43:01.880
Master Liang!

43:09.710 --> 43:10.510
Please help me.

43:11.030 --> 43:11.590
Alright, young lady.

43:12.030 --> 43:12.760
No need to beg me.

43:15.230 --> 43:15.960
Young lady,

43:16.400 --> 43:18.070
I'm starting to take a liking to you.
